{"id":"mayonnaise","lines":[{"t":0,"end":3.418,"chars":[4],"who":"Larry der Hummer","text":"“practice begins tonight 8 30 sharp”","de":"Das Training beginnt heute Abend, Punkt halb neun.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/01.mp3"},{"t":4.528,"end":7.395,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“stupid music rental clerk made me late”","de":"Blöder Verkäufer im Musikladen, wegen dem komm ich jetzt zu spät.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/02.mp3"},{"t":7.419,"end":10.662,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“that trilobite didn't know an oboe from an elbow”","de":"Dieser Trilobit konnte eine Oboe nicht von einem Ellenbogen unterscheiden.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/03.mp3"},{"t":10.662,"end":13.365,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“he elbow he more ban humor”","de":"Oboe, Ellenbogen — dem war das doch völlig egal.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/04.mp3"},{"t":19.195,"end":21.735,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“People People Settle Down”","de":"Leute! Leute! Ruhe jetzt!","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/05.mp3"},{"t":21.825,"end":22.719,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“ okay now”","de":"Okay, also.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/06.mp3"},{"t":22.739,"end":25.973,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“how many of you have played musical instruments before”","de":"Wie viele von euch haben schon mal ein Instrument gespielt?","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/07.mp3"},{"t":26.017,"end":28.122,"chars":[6],"who":"Plankton","text":"“do instruments of torture count”","de":"Zählen Folterinstrumente auch?","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/08.mp3"},{"t":28.144,"end":28.759,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“No”","de":"Nein.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/09.mp3"},{"t":28.768,"end":31.473,"chars":[2],"who":"Patrick","text":"“is mayonnaise an instrument”","de":"Ist Mayonnaise ein Instrument?","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/10.mp3"},{"t":31.473,"end":34.46,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“no patrick mayonnaise is not an instrument”","de":"Nein, Patrick, Mayonnaise ist kein Instrument.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/11.mp3"},{"t":35.221,"end":37.912,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“horseradish is not an instrument either”","de":"Meerrettich ist auch kein Instrument.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/12.mp3"},{"t":38.317,"end":41.324,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“that's fine no one has any experience ”","de":"Ist ja nicht schlimm, keiner von euch hat Erfahrung.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/13.mp3"},{"t":41.324,"end":44.861,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“fortunately, i have enough talent for all of you","de":"Zum Glück habe ich genug Talent für euch alle.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/14.mp3"},{"t":44.873,"end":52.748,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“(Laughing)”","de":"(Lacht)","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/15.mp3"},{"t":52.826,"end":54.542,"chars":[5],"who":"Mr. Krabs","text":"“when do we get the free food”","de":"Wann gibt's denn das Gratis-Essen?","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/16.mp3"},{"t":54.542,"end":58.328,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“okay try to repeat after me (Deep Breath in)”","de":"Okay, versucht es mir nachzumachen. (Atmet tief ein)","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/17.mp3"},{"t":60.288,"end":61.914,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“bra section go”","de":"Blechbläser, los!","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/18.mp3"},{"t":64.361,"end":65.312,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“now the wind”","de":"Jetzt die Holzbläser.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/19.mp3"},{"t":67.251,"end":68.451,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“and the drums”","de":"Und das Schlagzeug.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/20.mp3"},{"t":72.988,"end":74.732,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“too bad that didn't kill me”","de":"Schade, dass mich das nicht umgebracht hat.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/21.mp3"},{"t":75.534,"end":78.018,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“let's just try stepping in rhythm”","de":"Versuchen wir es einfach mal im Rhythmus zu marschieren.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/22.mp3"},{"t":78.045,"end":81.434,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“ now i want everyone to stand in straight rows of five”","de":"Und jetzt will ich alle in geraden Reihen zu fünft.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/23.mp3"},{"t":81.434,"end":83.301,"chars":[7],"who":"SpongeBob","text":"“is this the part where we start kicking”","de":"Ist das der Teil, wo wir anfangen zu treten?","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/24.mp3"},{"t":83.301,"end":85.891,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“no spongebob that's a chorus line”","de":"Nein, SpongeBob, das ist eine Tanzrevue.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/25.mp3"},{"t":85.891,"end":88.728,"chars":[2],"who":"Patrick","text":"“kicking oh i want to do some kicking”","de":"Treten? Oh, ich will auch treten!","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/26.mp3"},{"t":88.728,"end":89.593,"chars":[2],"who":"Patrick","text":"“(Kicking Noise)”","de":"(Tritt-Geräusche)","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/27.mp3"},{"t":89.603,"end":91.555,"chars":[3],"who":"Sandy","text":"“Why You”","de":"Warum du—","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/28.mp3"},{"t":91.555,"end":91.99,"chars":[3],"who":"Sandy","text":"“Why i outta”","de":"Also wirklich, ich könnte dir—","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/29.mp3"},{"t":91.99,"end":96.039,"chars":[2],"who":"Patrick","text":"“(Fighting Noises)”","de":"(Kampfgeräusche)","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/30.mp3"},{"t":97.064,"end":101.518,"chars":[2],"who":"Patrick","text":"“(Screaming)”","de":"(Schreit)","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/31.mp3"},{"t":105.927,"end":110.251,"chars":[2],"who":"Patrick","text":"“whoever's the owner of the white sedan you left your lights on”","de":"Wem auch immer die weiße Limousine gehört: Du hast das Licht angelassen.","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/32.mp3"},{"t":123.728,"end":125.993,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“okay that's perfect everybody”","de":"Okay, perfekt, alle zusammen!","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/33.mp3"},{"t":126.079,"end":128.176,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“Bubble Bowl here we come”","de":"Bubble Bowl, wir kommen!","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/34.mp3"},{"t":128.219,"end":130.787,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“flat twirlers really spin those things”","de":"Fahnenschwinger, dreht die Dinger richtig!","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/35.mp3"},{"t":130.809,"end":133.063,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“okay turn”","de":"Okay, drehen!","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/36.mp3"},{"t":133.16,"end":136.057,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“flag twirlers let's go i want to see some spinning”","de":"Fahnenschwinger, los! Ich will Drehungen sehen!","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/37.mp3"},{"t":136.295,"end":138.414,"chars":[1],"who":"Thaddäus","text":"“flag twirlers let's move come on”","de":"Fahnenschwinger, Bewegung, kommt schon!","orig":"scenes/mayonnaise/lines/38.mp3"}]}